{"id":"vod_zy360_65281","vodId":"65281","provider":"zy360","providerName":"360资源","type":2,"name":"间谍过家家 第一季 Part.2","name_cn":"间谍过家家 第一季 Part.2","date":"2022-01-01","year":"2022","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全37集","images":{"common":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20241006-1/8bb5cb7b28652f95753ffa86fd88a89c.jpg"},"summary":"人人都有不愿对他人露出的一面。这是一个情报战的年代，全球各国都全力参与其中，表面上却不动声色。东国和西国已陷入冷战长达十多年。“黄昏”是一名顶尖间谍，隶属西国专门对付东国的情报局WISE。他奉命执行一项秘密任务：追踪东国国家统一党党魁唐纳文‧戴斯蒙德的一举一动。这名危险人物为东西两国间的和平构成重重威胁。这场行动代号是“枭”。黄昏必须在一个星期内组织家庭，潜入戴斯蒙德儿子就读的名校，参加他们的日常社交聚会。他假扮成精神科医生洛伊德‧佛杰，迅速组成家庭，一切照计划进行，不料他的“女儿”安妮亚竟有读心术，“妻子”约儿更是个杀手！志同道合、互相隐瞒真实身份的三人就这么住在一块。维持世界和平的重责大任落在这个临时家庭的手上。事情的发展，无可预期！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-10-13 11:44:01","playable":true,"episodeCount":37,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"360zy","episodes":[{"name":"第01话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241006/AdtPBbiY/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241006/7sQSeqnO/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241006/A1h8iaqF/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241006/twStklP6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241006/jjnY2lf5/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241006/ozde1dWq/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241006/FhVYEs3E/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241006/zGjWUMxr/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241006/ZiegU1hx/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241006/8141RI1A/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241006/V6IuM1RE/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241006/UAGUbVKb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241006/Ll5FGYgi/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241006/6RhpxOqv/index.m3u8"},{"name":